warning
# Issue #1948: a repo lane's pass was cut short mid-lane by the fleet
# in-pass deadline (max_pass_runtime_seconds); remaining sub-phases defer
# to the next pass. Warning, not error: the pass still ends cleanly and
# returns a CommandResult carrying data["deadline_deferred"] -- nothing
# crashed, work was rescheduled. Sibling of fleet_pass_deadline_deferred
# (which covers never-started lanes); this one covers a lane that ran
# partially.
